# Stop a cut apple going brown
#
# Browning belongs only to the prepared cut_apple identity: an intact generic
# apple has no declared fresh surface. The response is a bounded oxygen/time
# observable, not enzyme turnover, taste, texture or food-safety advice.
register lv2

# Air control: a fresh surface browns as the shared clock advances.
add v1 cut_apple 20g
wait 900s
look v1

# Vitamin-C comparison: the same mass, air and time with ascorbate nearby.
# The model computes inhibition of the visible response; it does not claim
# permanent preservation.
new beaker
add v2 ascorbic_acid 0.01mol
add v2 cut_apple 20g
wait 900s
look v2
